{
  "id": "brio-independent",
  "title": {
    "ja": "Brio–Wu：別実装HLLDとの照合",
    "en": "Brio–Wu against an independent HLLD implementation"
  },
  "method_ids": [
    "hlld"
  ],
  "summary": {
    "ja": "公開HLLD-MC有限体積コードを、固定コミットから別に構築したAthena++のBrio–Wu参照と比較します。",
    "en": "Compare the published HLLD-MC finite-volume code with Brio–Wu reference data independently produced by Athena++ at a pinned commit."
  },
  "assumptions": {
    "ja": "1D、[0,1]、t=0.1、γ=2、Bx=0.75。左右(rho,p,By)=(1,1,1)/(0.125,0.1,-1)、速度ゼロ、流出境界。",
    "en": "1D, [0,1], t=0.1, gamma=2, Bx=0.75; left/right (rho,p,By)=(1,1,1)/(0.125,0.1,-1), zero velocity, outflow boundaries."
  },
  "algorithm": {
    "ja": "アトラス側はMC再構成とSSPRK2、参照は独立C++のHLLD・PLM・RK3。異なる実装ですがHLLDという数値流束の系列は共有します。",
    "en": "Atlas uses MC reconstruction and SSPRK2; the independent C++ reference uses HLLD, PLM and RK3. Implementations differ while sharing the HLLD flux family."
  },
  "validation": {
    "ja": "128/256/512セルを、2048/4096セルで再実行した独立参照の保存的細胞平均と比較。rho/ByのL1誤差、格子改善、密度・圧力正値性を判定します。",
    "en": "Compare 128/256/512 cells with conservative averages of independently rerun 2048/4096-cell references. Check density/By L1 errors, refinement and positive density/pressure."
  },
  "limits": {
    "ja": "Brio–Wuの複合波を含む数値解との照合であり、一般MHD Riemann問題の唯一の厳密解とは呼びません。参照の再生成にはC++コンパイルが必要で、通常Python実行は同梱参照を使います。",
    "en": "This compares numerical solutions including the Brio–Wu compound wave; it is not a claim of a unique exact solution for arbitrary MHD Riemann problems. Reference regeneration requires C++ compilation; routine Python runs use the stored reference."
  },
